abstract = {Attempts to supplant the wave-functions of many-particle systems by reduced two-particle density matrices. For that purpose it would be necessary to find criteria by which any two-particle function could be identified as possible two-particle reductions of some N-particle density matrix. In the author's terminology this is the problems of N-representability. In pursuit of this problem a number of theorems are established but no conclusive solution is arrived at. },
